msgstr "Дублировать запись в другой модели"

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/automated_actions.rst:463
msgid ""
"Another automation rule with :ref:`studio/automated-actions/action-update-"
"record` actions can be created to update the fields of the new or duplicated "
