#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/models_modules_apps.rst:192
msgid "The :guilabel:`Chatter` feature can be added at a later stage."
msgstr "Функцию :guilabel:`Chatter` можно добавить позже."

#: ../../export/content/applications/studio/models_modules_apps.rst:196
msgid "Chatter feature on the Form view"
